          d="M7.2 3.6 10.8 5.7v4.2L7.2 12 3.6 9.9V5.7zM16.8 3.6 20.4 5.7v4.2L16.8 12l-3.6-2.1V5.7zM12 12.4l3.6 2.1v4.2L12 20.8l-3.6-2.1v-4.2z"
